### Perf Insight - sample requests (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
### With profile "dev" you can use headers instead of a real Azure AD token:
@base = http://localhost:8080
@admin = X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
@from = 2026-06-01
@to = 2026-09-30

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/api/org/me
X-Dev-User: priya.sharma@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

### ---------- ADMIN: connect a LIVE Jira project (uses JIRA_EMAIL / JIRA_API_TOKEN) ----------
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tool-configs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "toolType": "JIRA",
  "mode": "LIVE",
  "name": "Jira Cloud - PAY (live)",
  "baseUrl": "https://YOUR-DOMAIN.atlassian.net",
  "credentialRef": "jira",
  "settings": { "projectKey": "PAY", "authType": "BASIC", "browseUrl": "https://YOUR-DOMAIN.atlassian.net", "storyPointsField": "customfield_10016" }
}

### ---------- ADMIN: connect a LIVE GitHub repo (uses GITHUB_TOKEN) ----------
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tool-configs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "toolType": "GIT",
  "mode": "LIVE",
  "name": "GitHub - payments-api (live)",
  "credentialRef": "github",
  "settings": { "owner": "YOUR-ORG", "repo": "YOUR-REPO", "includeCommits": true, "maxPrPages": 5 }
}

### Sync one tool config now (incremental)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tool-configs/1/sync
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### See / change a project's field mapping (no code change)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/tool-configs/1/mapping
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### Upload an export (CSV or JSON) for a FILE-mode config
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tool-configs/13/import
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="INS_export.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./src/main/resources/mock/jira/INS_export.csv
--b--

### ---------- Identity ----------
GET {{base}}/api/identity/unmatched
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### Link Karthik's GitHub account (id from the unmatched list) to his profile
POST {{base}}/api/identity/accounts/REPLACE_ACCOUNT_ID/link
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

{ "associateId": 8, "note": "ksubbu is Karthik's GitHub login", "addAlias": true }

### ---------- Org: move someone mid-period ----------
POST {{base}}/api/admin/org/assignments/move
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

{ "associateId": 5, "toProjectId": 2, "persona": "SENIOR_ENGINEER", "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-15" }

### ---------- Manual data ----------
POST {{base}}/api/activities/manual
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: kavya.reddy@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

{ "associateId": 12, "projectId": 4, "type": "DOCUMENT", "title": "Data retention policy (client wiki)",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-10T10:00:00Z", "reason": "Client wiki cannot be integrated" }

### Edit a field on top of source data (source value is preserved)
POST {{base}}/api/activities/1/overrides
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: priya.sharma@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

{ "field": "attributes.storyPoints", "value": "5", "reason": "Re-estimated in refinement" }

### Context note
POST {{base}}/api/context-notes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: priya.sharma@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

{ "associateId": 5, "type": "SUPPORT_DUTY", "startDate": "2026-09-14", "endDate": "2026-09-18", "note": "On-call week" }

### ---------- Model ----------
GET {{base}}/api/models/active
X-Dev-User: sneha.iyer@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: EMPLOYEE

### ---------- Scoring + reports ----------
POST {{base}}/api/scoring/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

{ "from": "{{from}}", "to": "{{to}}" }

### Project in focus
GET {{base}}/api/reports/projects/1?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: priya.sharma@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

### Project trend (monthly snapshots, each with the model version it used)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/projects/1/trend?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

### Associate in focus (Vikram moved PAY -> CLM on 1 Aug)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/associates/6?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

### Employee: own view only
GET {{base}}/api/reports/me?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: sneha.iyer@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: EMPLOYEE

### Employee trying to see someone else -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/reports/associates/14?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: sneha.iyer@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: EMPLOYEE

### Explain a score + drill down to evidence
GET {{base}}/api/reports/scores/1/explain
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

###
GET {{base}}/api/reports/scores/1/evidence?measureKey=code.prs_merged
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

### ---------- AI ----------
GET {{base}}/api/insights/anomalies?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

###
POST {{base}}/api/insights/associates/14/summary?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: priya.sharma@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: MANAGER

###
POST {{base}}/api/insights/projects/1/summary?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
X-Dev-User: head@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: SERVICE_HEAD

### =================== LIVE JIRA (needs JIRA_BASE_URL, JIRA_EMAIL, JIRA_API_TOKEN) ===================
### 1. Is the token OK?
GET {{base}}/api/jira/connection
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### 2. Which projects can the token see?
GET {{base}}/api/jira/projects
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### 3. Who is "nithish.kumar" in project KEY?
GET {{base}}/api/jira/users/search?name=nithish.kumar&projectKey=KEY
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### 4. Tickets, story points, time logged, commits, PRs
GET {{base}}/api/jira/users/nithish.kumar/summary?projectKey=KEY&from=2026-06-01&to=2026-09-30
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN

### 4b. Same, whole history, with his GitHub login for commit/PR author matching
GET {{base}}/api/jira/users/nithish.kumar/summary?projectKey=KEY&gitAliases=nithish-k
X-Dev-User: admin@psiog.com
X-Dev-Roles: ADMIN
